/.workbuddy-ai/
/tmp*/

# Session scratch / handoff artifacts (kept on disk, never versioned)
/_qa_bugrepro/
/freebuff-chat-*.md
/SESSION_SUMMARY.md
/tests/_browser_smoke.png
# Audit probe output: a live-browser sweep writes screenshots next to the suites
# that took them. They are evidence for one run, regenerable, and 3 MB each set.
/tests/_audit_shots/
/tests/_browser_*.png

# UI evidence shots (regenerate with tests/_ui_capture.py; never versioned - repo already carries 69 PNGs)
/impl-shots/ui_audit/
# A gun_pen audit RUN writes here (gitignored scratch). Top-level impl-shots/ is
# the versioned evidence set the verdict tables cite, so a run must not overwrite
# it in place; refreshing it is the explicit act AUDIT_PROMOTE=1.
# Guard: tests/test_repo_hygiene.py
/impl-shots/runs/
